:[{"g":1,"a":0,"t":"Climb out of the vat","x":"Fluid drains from the vat. A voice from the walls: “Maintenance unit K-7, decanted. Work cycle begins.” Stencilled on the glass: PROPERTY OF THE LONG PATIENCE."},{"g":1,"a":3.6,"t":"Search the vat bay","x":"Forty-one vats. Most hold spare bodies, half-grown, waiting for you to fail. The rest are cracked and dry."},{"g":1,"a":4.1,"t":"Wake the bay terminal","x":"WARDEN LOG: Crew of 3,112 in stasis, vitals nominal. Degraded systems: food, reactor, stardrive. Maintenance clone line K authorised. Clones are consumable. Neural echo retained for efficiency."},{"g":2,"a":12,"t":"Force the pressure hatch","x":"The hatch gives with a scream of old hydraulics. Beyond it lies the hydroponics ring the crew will eat from when they wake. It is rotting."},{"g":2,"a":15.8,"t":"Map the ring corridors","x":"Eleven kilometres of ring. Earlier units scratched their numbers into the bulkheads: K-3 WAS HERE. K-5 DIED HERE."},{"g":3,"a":16.5,"t":"Restore the irrigation pumps","x":"Water moves through the beds again. When the crew wakes, they will eat from them and never ask who fixed them."},{"g":8,"a":17.1,"t":"Clear a rot-crawler nest","x":"The nests are gone. The crawlers had been feeding on the crew’s future harvest."},{"g":9,"a":18.1,"t":"Reach the abandoned medbay","x":"The medbay is fully stocked for the crew. A notice on every cabinet: NOT FOR MAINTENANCE UNITS."},{"g":10,"a":24.8,"t":"Decrypt the gene-sequencer logs","x":"The sequencer logs explain your short lives: the clone template was made cheap on purpose. You find a partial patch and apply it anyway."},{"g":15,"a":21.3,"t":"Repair the spine lift","x":"The spine lift climbs past the stasis decks. Through frosted glass, row after row of sleeping faces."},{"g":18,"a":29,"t":"Reprogram maintenance drones","x":"The maintenance drones stop circling and start working. Like you, they were never asked."},{"g":20,"a":30.6,"t":"Vent the reactor coolant","x":"Coolant screams into the void. The reactor drops out of the red, and the hum of the stasis decks steadies."},{"g":23,"a":29.8,"t":"Breach the armoury","x":"Sealed rifles, crew access only. One rack is empty. A clone before you tried something. WARDEN logged it as a malfunction."},{"g":25,"a":32.5,"t":"Fight through the security deck","x":"The security drones were guarding the crew’s command deck from its own maintenance staff. Not any more."},{"g":29,"a":43.2,"t":"Restore bridge power","x":"The bridge lights up. The chronometer says the ship is 61 years behind schedule. The crew slept through all of it."}],"lastOrder":["wake","vats","search","cables","heatpaste","terminal","hydraul","hatch","nests","survey","crawlers","mapring","valves","medpath","irrigation","medbay","strains","seqpower","liftshaft","genelog","lift","droneyard","coolmap","drones","packer","vent","armdoor","armory","secscan","secdeck","relays","ovens","bridgepower","navboot"],"lastJob":null,"set":{"speed":1,"autoFood":true,"autoEat":true,"foodDays":2,"foodPct":50,"restAt":5,"keepQueue":true,"deathScreen":true,"deathPause":true,"startPaused":true,"bgPause":true,"pauseCross":true,"pauseRunEnd":true,"pauseDone":false,"replay":true,"fillCross":true,"autoFeed":true,"boost":false,"boostX":2,"paused":false},"stats":{"bestAge":0,"deaths":29,"daysLived":58560.74360000598,"played":13438.234099969979,"bestDays":57.955530000026215},"a2":{"open":false,"hon":0,"lv":{},"perks":{},"fin":0},"branch":null,"merge":null,"a2run":{"reached":{},"done":{}},"pr":{"n":0,"pts":0,"growth":0,"drain":0,"hp":0,"speed":0,"carry":0,"runs":[]},"won":false,"winGen":0,"bank":23961.08000000001,"saved":1793745072244,"intro":true,"life":{"day":3349.8216000013517,"hp":289.93890144700134,"rations":108,"food":{"ration":108},"salvage":68.5450000003405,"lv":{"eng":0,"bio":0,"cbt":0,"hak":0,"nav":0,"res":0},"xp":{"eng":0,"bio":0,"cbt":0,"hak":0,"nav":0,"res":0},"echo0":{"eng":0,"bio":0,"cbt":0,"hak":0,"nav":0,"res":0},"done":{"wake":1,"vats":1,"search":1,"cables":1,"heatpa